# CR 707.10: a copy of a spell copies "all decisions made for it, including ... additional or alternative costs", so the copy of an
# Exhale cast with a Dragon beheld is beheld too and asks {4}. Bot1 casts Dispelling Exhale beheld (the Kokusho in hand is revealed) at
# Bot2's Bolt, then flashes in Lutri, the Spellchaser, whose enters trigger copies the Exhale (the copy aimed at the Bolt again).
# Bot2 has exactly {R}{R}{R}{R} spare after the Bolt: the copy, on top of the stack, asks {4} and Bot2 pays it all, so the pool is empty
# when the original asks for its own {4} (a copy that asked only {2} would leave {R}{R} floating), which Bot2 declines: the Bolt is countered.

